  (~37%) Digdir-arsverk variants all hitting the same 2-3 Hovudtal table
  chunks; that would have let any config that's good at one specific
  table type dominate the leaderboard. v2 drops the 6 most-redundant
  arsverk variants (tombstoned, see end) and lifts the 12-case
